If you would like to ingest the data source data into the pipeline but no longer want the data source to stream, then disable the accept streaming option. The data source will no longer stream, but given that the data source may have sent some data before the server closes the connection, it will still send that buffered data even after you disable the accept streaming option, but only for the current job.
