The first and most important thing that I assume you already know is that just from attention over many 1D data points you cannot form a meaningful sequence - when you attention over a position the only result can be a weighted  average and that's independent of any embeddings. So we need positional embeddings precisely to have a (fuzzy) serial structure over which attention then forms higher order concepts.

