## Training Convolutional Neural Networks

CNNs are trained using Stochastic Gradient Descent in batches, the same way you train standard multilayer perceptron networks.

During the backpropagation step of training phase, Stochastic Gradient Descent computes the gradient of the error of the network with respect to the network’s parameters.

